{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14376","headline":"送妓人出家 · 杨郇伯","name":"送妓人出家","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尽出花钿与四隣，云鬟剪落厌残春。\n暂惊风烛难留世，便是莲花不染身。\n贝叶欲翻迷锦字，梵声初学悞梁尘。\n从今艳色归空後，湘浦应无解佩人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨郇伯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14376.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14376","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}